{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12235170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12235170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1223517001:1":{"text":"Don't worry. You will stop feeling the itch soon.","source_cn":"放心吧，待会就不会痒了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1975282B100ECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223517002:1":{"text":"Hm...?","source_cn":"啊？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623A21BCCA067E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223517003:1":{"text":"We've confirmed it—this powder is made from snake venom in Viperian's lab, and it's fatal.","source_cn":"我们已经确认过了，这是维珀里安实验室的蛇毒，吃了就没救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BA7C52EBBF5F3FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223517004:1":{"text":"Dead people don't feel itchy!","source_cn":"死人，是不会发痒的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64847A2F56A4984B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223517005:0":{"text":"Magister, please! I'll do everything you ask. Please help me!","source_cn":"——魔法师！大魔法师！我完了，你要什么我都答应！救救我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF6F9DA4F81EBAF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, please! I'll do everything you ask. Please help me!","female":"Magister, please! I'll do everything you ask. Please help me!","variant_male_record_index":"140453","variant_female_record_index":"140454","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1223517005":{"text":"Magister, please! I'll do everything you ask. Please help me!","source_cn":"——魔法师！大魔法师！我完了，你要什么我都答应！救救我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF6F9DA4F81EBAF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, please! I'll do everything you ask. Please help me!","female":"Magister, please! I'll do everything you ask. Please help me!","variant_male_record_index":"140453","variant_female_record_index":"140454","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223517006:0":{"text":"You have a heart of gold!","source_cn":"大善人！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8249827A85D0C750","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You have a heart of gold!","female":"You have a heart of gold!","variant_male_record_index":"140455","variant_female_record_index":"140456","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223517008:1":{"text":"Actually, there's a way. You know the carmines planted by the Whispers, right? You can brew some petals in water and drink it to neutralize the poison.","source_cn":"倒也有办法，血薇帮种植的血薇花瓣知道吧，泡过的水喝一下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6103940240301054","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223517009:1":{"text":"H-how can I be sure you are speaking the truth?","source_cn":"我、我怎么知道你是不是在骗我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1932D08B036E0448","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1223517009":{"text":"H-how can I be sure you are speaking the truth?","source_cn":"我、我怎么知道你是不是在骗我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1932D08B036E0448","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223517010:1":{"text":"But... wouldn't I be walking straight into my enemies' trap?","source_cn":"但是、但是……让我去找血薇帮要解药，不就等于自投罗网？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F65655BB3A281C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223517011:1":{"text":"That's right—you must turn yourself in to stay alive!","source_cn":"没错，你必须乖乖认罪！才能保命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABE9E5F67BA003FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1223517012:1":{"text":"Argh! I can't accept it!","source_cn":"可恶，不甘心啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB984EC677760DCF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1223517013:1":{"text":"What does revenge even mean when you're dying?","source_cn":"命都没了还谈什么报仇？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3562ADFC85684B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1223517014:1":{"text":"You can give up the antidote, but we're taking it!","source_cn":"没错啊，你不要解药，我们要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x177EF6DC30716C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1223517015:1":{"text":"Alright... Guys, let's surrender to stay alive.","source_cn":"好吧……兄弟们，为了保命放弃抵抗，跟我去血薇帮认罪吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162CF24F5CA119D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1223517016:0":{"text":"Knox, you can take them back. They're all begging to go with you!","source_cn":"诺克，你把他们带回去吧，他们现在求都要求着跟你回血薇帮呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847ADDE4B09C3355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1223517017:1":{"text":"Got it. Thanks for your hard work!","source_cn":"明白，辛苦你们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x415B8CEE7CA0B583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:1223517018:0":{"text":"Renata and the rest are escorted back to the Carmine Whispers' place...","source_cn":"雷纳塔等人被押回了血薇帮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh